          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchanïn ECHOTYON ngat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wero chi, rosa lentöy pipö Israel, sïwïyagh nyï imwochinenyi chane kïpö osis cho chang cho pkonöy, pö osis cho lowöch. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo lenchinö chane lentöy Echotyon TORORÖT, ‘Möminye ngölyontenyan nyo ropu nyo kogh, opuntenan lawel lenyini kamwaghan.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.28"
            ]
          }
        }
